WEBVTT

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.140
Welcome.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.530
You’re Ryo Mizuhara, correct?

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.130
Y-Yes, I am…

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:36.200
Let me get straight to the point.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.770
Please don’t get involved with my sister, Emiho Mutsu.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:46.460
My sister will soon marry the fiancé that my parents chose for her.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.750
Forget about…

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.100
Emiho.

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:06.630
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:13.450
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:20.810
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:26.440
and paint them on my heart.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.400
The sweetness

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:34.490
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:35.950
The time

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:42.370
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:50.510
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.350
float in the wind,

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.230
flowing toward you,

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:57.700
freely.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:04.560
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:08.190
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:13.190
Beyond the Love and Gunfire!
A Great Battle!!

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.910
Mizu… hara…

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.280
According to the report,

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:02.210
this sudden decision was made by her brother Naohiro,

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:05.140
who made it because he was concerned about Emiho-sama’s change of heart.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:08.060
Emiho-sama is meeting her fiancé for the first time.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.820
The actual engagement will be at seven o’clock.

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:13.860
The location is an extravagant cruise liner that is anchored in the Tokyo Bay.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.700
I’m sure they picked that location to avoid any intrusions from the outside

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:19.990
but it works well for us too.

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:23.680
We won’t be spotted even if we get a little messy.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:28.920
Wait for me, Ojo.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.700
But, if we succeed,

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:35.430
Ryo-sama!

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:36.840
I know.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:44.580
Man, what a surprise.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:48.480
Emiho, you are much more beautiful in person than you are in the photo.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.860
I didn’t expect Naohiro’s sister to be such a beauty.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:57.110
With this engagement, our relationship will grow even closer.

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:59.300
To our bright future!

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:01.800
Cheers.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:07.580
I will have you come live in America after our marriage.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:11.290
The spot I have chosen for our new home is in the most prestigious section of Beverly Hills.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.070
I’m sure you will like it, Emy.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.800
Emi-rin, Ojo, now I’m Emy.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:21.350
I guess I’m destined to not be addressed by my proper name.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:22.970
Look.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:27.330
The jewels in the sky are magnifying the dawning of our new relationship.

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:29.100
Is that so?

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:30.230
Oh?

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:35.750
What?!

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.510
What’s going on?!

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.250
Emiho Mutsu-sama.

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.940
I’m here to pick you up.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:01.970
Why are you…

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.450
Why are you in a swimsuit?

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.890
Oh, I didn’t mean to!

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:08.250
Here!

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:12.010
Let’s try it again!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:14.360
The warrior of love, Shizuka Masuda,

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:18.460
is coming now!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.490
Ojo!

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:21.870
Mizuhara!

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.840
But how did you…

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:25.870
Now, hurry!

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:28.000
Let’s run away and let Shizuka take care of this!

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.210
B-But…

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.310
Don’t worry.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:37.070
I wouldn’t be satisfied if I won him over without a fair match.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:38.840
You…

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:50.690
I won’t let you!

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:51.450
Get them!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.380
Muscle! Muscle!

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.580
Tight!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.710
Six pack!

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:06.380
Sorry, but Ryo-sama has given me permission to use all of my abilities.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.930
So I will be pretty rough on you!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.270
I see the signal.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:18.520
All units, move out!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:39.070
Come on!

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:39.670
Eliminate them!

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.500
All right!

00:06:57.590 --> 00:06:59.610
This feels so good!

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:02.070
Ah, so dreamy!

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.400
After them, after them!

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:16.600
Wait up, my new honey!

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.690
I’ve decided.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:20.270
You are going to be my future wife!

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.710
Marry me!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:38.920
Hey, that’s as far as you go!

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:54.520
Ryo!

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:59.610
Hey, Emi-rin!

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:01.960
Brother! Emiho-san!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.200
Moriya!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:03.960
Akane!

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:20.540
Mizuhara, this is really reckless.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.670
I intended this to be your rescue.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:26.340
Did you not want it?

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.470
Ryo! Emi-rin!

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:33.410
Brother!

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.140
Why you…

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:37.980
What are you doing?!

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:39.650
Get our boat ready too!

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:42.080
I won’t let you!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.340
What?

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:45.860
I request that you not bother them!

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:47.340
Fire!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.950
Oh, no!

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.410
Damn, I won’t let them get away with this.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:01.920
Both the Mutsu family’s future and my future is riding on this marriage.

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:04.250
I see our target at ten o’clock.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.170
Good.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:06.960
I see them at two o’clock too!

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:07.590
What?!

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:09.380
Wow, at eight o’clock too!

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:09.680
Eh?

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:10.680
At three o’clock too!

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:11.110
No way!

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.740
Here!

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.370
There!

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:17.560
What the heck?!

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:49.070
So, Ojo, do you feel refreshed now?

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.590
Yeah, I give up.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.070
I can’t say anything after you’ve gone so far.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:56.570
Now I understand it very well.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.260
I want to stay with everyone.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.700
I want to stay with you.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.820
I was happy to see you there.

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:12.720
Really.

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:14.320
Ojo.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:23.480
Mizuhara.

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:25.980
O-Ojo…

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:39.270
Okay, that’s enough.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:42.540
You can’t go off by yourself, Emiho-sama.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.340
Ryo-sama, thanks for waiting!

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:52.490
Now that I have completed my duty,

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:54.490
I want the kiss you promised!

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:55.780
Promised?

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:56.870
What’s that about?

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:58.030
How cruel!

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:00.240
You promised me that you would give me a kiss

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:03.290
if I successfully rescued Emiho-sama!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:07.000
Ojo, I was just making it up!

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.710
I thought you hated her so much,

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:11.170
but I guess you don’t feel that way about her anymore?

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:13.580
Why don’t you give her the kiss or whatever else she desires?

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:14.580
Ojo?!

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:17.010
Now that we have permission from Emiho-sama, as well…

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:18.050
Ryo-sama!

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:19.720
Stop it!

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.160
Hey, Ojo, help!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:23.450
Oh, my honey!

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:28.400
If you want to receive a kiss, I’ll do it!

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.610
Wait, my sweetheart!

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:34.720
Help me!

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.450
Kiss me!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:39.950
Please!

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:41.410
Kiss me, please!

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:47.290
Oh well.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.170
You owe me one.

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:51.130
So, Mizuhara,

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:54.570
it’s your turn to see how you really feel.

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:56.860
To be continued

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:01.310
The moment came

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:05.310
very much out of the blue.

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:10.450
You showed up right in front of me,

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.170
then started to change everything.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.000
If my meeting you

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:20.850
is not by fate,

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:26.210
there are no miracles,

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:31.400
even if I search all over the world.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.790
Embracing love,

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.720
kissing love,

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.650
holding love,

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.990
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:50.980
Please look at me and me alone,

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:54.400
forever.
